    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a419ef5b1578c9530cee8284",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "作为后冠赛马娘，\n我想一对一地、好好指导她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3173e1decf191f169ea44425b6a003ac3a246450d8e45c65c53547f0532c944",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df88c637f3d9f098c624566f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后冠赛马娘的育成俱乐部大多规模很小。\n她们选择的都是更紧密、更细致的指导方式。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3f04026fea65f556fefc98e704d78cb8b8644b9d74b3de36a26a7865222dd17",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4490749efb770c031e4465a7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……然后你的三年时光，今年就是最后了",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2883b7ecd3d34ab7ca9dc5d6d229ba46ccce6148093fbf1bea1bcf436126887",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
