    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2152bddd611f628cb4b73fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对赛马娘来说至关重要的那最初三年……\n我已经享受到极致了。再没有比那更尽兴的了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92ed6a172571acf4743080d56273bdc5654d6f3a1a8e778ab2f82ead05b6024e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
