    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9eeb8ee96e763905425bfed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "Past the peak――一旦过了巅峰，\n剩下的就只有衰退了。会渐渐再也\n跟不上新世代的孩子们……――",
      "source_fingerprint": "610bc138bf0ab77e5e9424a21ae8cbda89a7c2433fa058415ae307e01394acfa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d57378ec1e54178331ac24da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勇敢之心",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a26c04a8af8557f331ed7076671e2fce274ed0afd52fdd6e88b73fe92f7c8e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
