    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcd5966894109196c088422a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后默默消失在历史的阴影中。既然如此――\n不如趁身体还有活力的时候，向下个step迈进……\n我觉得这样未尝不好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98f3b097442e805c47487e5927dfe6890543299c51c5858ab6b52078b2a9a688",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb60ff302fe68712922eb77d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……虽然有点提前，你休息一下吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "36728d5b6cc58cab0a2741a1c5f2ab4789eb248919e1c32ea8416ddf90c72d53",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
