    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c3f26163e4b75fe74e1bec4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是我教出来的孩子们活跃起来，\n说不定大家会说……\n“是力量那个世代的指导者啊”的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6392bc9e3a5b252205a441473cfce3922e1f66bd4f86ce22f0973dbca09f43a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112117.json",
      "json_path": [
