      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是唯一，我能为那孩子做的事了。\n……因为已经无法再和力量\n在赛场上互相碰撞了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b7a8435e66708631093cf084feed2cba0b2b3db4a51028080fe673eae7bb9ae",
