      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与对手们心灵碰撞时的她，\n总是那么的生机勃勃――\n那样的她，真的无比快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "578d7d89cd497e2136c69c7772f8087e5bdd56f60e2137b5d9ece09407251222",
